{"seq":2,"slug":"positional-encoding-2d","title":"二维位置编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture/positional-encoding-2d","wordCount":1300,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"二维位置编码\">二维位置编码</h1><p>自注意力有一个对图像致命的性质：它对输入顺序完全无感。把 196 个 patch token 的次序打乱，注意力的输出只是跟着换个位置，数值不变——这叫排列等变。可图像里「天空在上、地面在下」是硬约束，左上角的 patch 和右下角的 patch 绝不能被当成可互换的。补上这道缺失的空间信息，就是位置编码的职责。视觉的特殊之处在于，位置是<strong>二维</strong>的，且分辨率会变，这两点让视觉位置编码比语言版多了不少花样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-给无序的注意力补上空间\">核心概念：给无序的注意力补上空间</h2><p>自注意力对顺序无感，可图像的空间排布不能乱——这就是位置编码要补的洞。视觉里它比语言版多两个难点：位置是二维的、分辨率会变。这篇的主线是「为什么非加不可 → 主流方案怎么编码 → 换分辨率为何出事 → 2025 年 RoPE 怎么根治」。下面从排列等变性这个根说起。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么非加不可-排列等变性的代价\">为什么非加不可：排列等变性的代价</h2><p>形式上，对任意置换矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，自注意力满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mtext> </mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Attn}(PX) = P\\,\\mathrm{Attn}(X)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Attn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Attn</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这意味着不注入位置，模型根本无法分辨 patch 的空间排布，一张正常的猫和把它打乱成马赛克的猫在它眼里等价。位置编码就是给第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 加上一个与位置绑定的向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>←</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_i \\leftarrow x_i + p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，从此「左上」和「右下」携带了不同的位置签名。这个加法发生在 <a href=\"../foundations/patch-embedding\">图像分块与嵌入</a> 产出 token 之后、进入第一层注意力之前。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条主流路线-可学习-正弦-二维分解\">三条主流路线：可学习、正弦、二维分解</h2><p>视觉位置编码大致分三类，下表对比其要点。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>可学习一维</td>\n<td>每个位置一个可训练向量</td>\n<td>简单、原版 ViT 采用</td>\n<td>换分辨率需插值，外推差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>正弦（固定）</td>\n<td>不同频率正余弦</td>\n<td>无参数、可外推</td>\n<td>视觉上略逊可学习</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二维分解</td>\n<td>行编码 + 列编码拼接</td>\n<td>显式建模二维结构</td>\n<td>实现稍复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对位置偏置</td>\n<td>注意力里加 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>平移不变、Swin 采用</td>\n<td>仅相对、无绝对锚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RoPE（旋转）</td>\n<td>对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q,K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 按位置旋转</td>\n<td>任意分辨率、外推强</td>\n<td>需适配二维</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>原版 ViT 用的是最朴素的可学习一维位置：把 196 个位置各配一个可训练向量。它简单有效，但埋了一个雷——这些向量是按 14×14 网格学出来的，一旦推理时换了分辨率，网格尺寸变了，学好的位置表就对不上号了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"换分辨率的麻烦与插值\">换分辨率的麻烦与插值</h2><p>这是 ViT 工程里最容易踩的坑之一。预训练在 224×224（14×14 网格）学了 196 个位置向量；下游想用 384×384（24×24 网格）做精调，需要 576 个位置向量，可你只有 196 个。标准做法是把 196 个位置向量 reshape 回 14×14 的二维网格，用双三次插值放大到 24×24，再拉平。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;def interpolate_pos_embed(pos_embed, old_grid=14, new_grid=24):&#10;    # pos_embed: [1, 1 + old_grid**2, D]，第 0 个是 CLS，不参与插值&#10;    cls, grid = pos_embed[:, :1], pos_embed[:, 1:]&#10;    D = grid.shape[-1]&#10;    grid = grid.reshape(1, old_grid, old_grid, D).permute(0, 3, 1, 2)&#10;    grid = F.interpolate(grid, size=(new_grid, new_grid),&#10;                         mode=&quot;bicubic&quot;, align_corners=False)&#10;    grid = grid.permute(0, 2, 3, 1).reshape(1, new_grid * new_grid, D)&#10;    return torch.cat([cls, grid], dim=1)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interpolate_pos_embed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(pos_embed, old_grid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, new_grid</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # pos_embed: [1, 1 + old_grid**2, D]，第 0 个是 CLS，不参与插值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    cls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pos_embed[:, :</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], pos_embed[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    D </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid.shape[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid.reshape(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, old_grid, old_grid, D).permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.interpolate(grid, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(new_grid, new_grid),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                         mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bicubic\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">align_corners</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> grid.permute(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).reshape(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, new_grid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_grid, D)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.cat([</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, grid], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>插值能用，但会掉点——位置信息是「猜」出来的，不是学出来的。这个老毛病催生了对「天生支持任意分辨率」的位置编码的需求。微调里这一步是必做的，详见 <a href=\"../practice/vit-finetuning\">微调与迁移</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[预训练 14x14 网格&lt;br/&gt;学 196 个位置向量] --&gt; B[下游换 384 分辨率&lt;br/&gt;需 24x24=576 个]&#10;  B --&gt; C[reshape 回 14x14 二维]&#10;  C --&gt; D[双三次插值放大到 24x24]&#10;  D --&gt; E[拉平后参与精调]&#10;  E --&gt; F[可用但掉点&lt;br/&gt;位置是猜的]&#10;  F --&gt; G[更优解: RoPE 原生任意分辨率]\">flowchart TD\n  A[预训练 14x14 网格&lt;br/&gt;学 196 个位置向量] --&gt; B[下游换 384 分辨率&lt;br/&gt;需 24x24=576 个]\n  B --&gt; C[reshape 回 14x14 二维]\n  C --&gt; D[双三次插值放大到 24x24]\n  D --&gt; E[拉平后参与精调]\n  E --&gt; F[可用但掉点&lt;br/&gt;位置是猜的]\n  F --&gt; G[更优解: RoPE 原生任意分辨率]</pre><h2 id=\"2025-年的答案-rope-与相对偏置\">2025 年的答案：RoPE 与相对偏置</h2><p>两条现代路线绕开了插值难题。其一是 Swin 用的<strong>相对位置偏置</strong>：不给绝对位置，而在窗口内每对 token 间加一个可学习的相对偏置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只依赖二者的相对位移。这带来平移不变性，且窗口大小固定时天然规整，机制见 <a href=\"../variants/hierarchical-swin\">层次化 (Swin)</a>。其二是 <strong>RoPE（旋转位置编码）</strong>：不做加法，而是按位置对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q,K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 向量做旋转，相对位置关系隐含在旋转角差里。Meta 在 2025 年 8 月的 DINOv3（arXiv:2508.10104）把位置编码从可学习换成 RoPE，正是为了让同一个 70 亿参数模型无需重训就能在 256×256 到 4096×4096 的任意分辨率上推理——这直接消除了上一节插值掉点的问题。把位置编码做对，是 ViT 走向「任意分辨率视觉基础模型」的关键一步。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自注意力排列等变，对 patch 顺序无感，必须显式注入位置，否则无法分辨空间排布。</li>\n<li>主流方案有可学习一维、正弦、二维分解、相对偏置、RoPE；原版 ViT 用最朴素的可学习一维。</li>\n<li>可学习位置的硬伤是换分辨率要插值（reshape 成二维网格双三次放大），能用但掉点。</li>\n<li>2025 年起 RoPE（DINOv3 采用）与相对偏置（Swin 采用）成为支持任意分辨率、外推更强的现代答案。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>位置编码加在哪一步：<a href=\"../foundations/patch-embedding\">图像分块与嵌入</a></li>\n<li>相对位置偏置在窗口注意力里的用法：<a href=\"../variants/hierarchical-swin\">层次化 (Swin)</a></li>\n<li>微调时位置插值的实操：<a href=\"../practice/vit-finetuning\">微调与迁移</a></li>\n<li>序列模型里的位置概念（跨 hub）：<a href=\"../../deep-learning/sequence-models/rnn-fundamentals\">深度学习 · RNN 基础</a></li>\n<li>高分辨率切片在 VLM 中的处理（跨 hub）：<a href=\"../../vision-language-models/architecture/high-resolution-tiling\">视觉语言模型 · 高分辨率切片</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"二维位置编码","id":"二维位置编码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：给无序的注意力补上空间","id":"核心概念-给无序的注意力补上空间"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么非加不可：排列等变性的代价","id":"为什么非加不可-排列等变性的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"三条主流路线：可学习、正弦、二维分解","id":"三条主流路线-可学习-正弦-二维分解"},{"level":2,"text":"换分辨率的麻烦与插值","id":"换分辨率的麻烦与插值"},{"level":2,"text":"2025 年的答案：RoPE 与相对偏置","id":"2025-年的答案-rope-与相对偏置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"视觉自注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture/self-attention-vision"},"next":{"title":"类别 token 与池化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/vision-transformers-architectures/architecture/cls-token-pooling"}}